Résumé projet Surprend Moi
The file has been read and understood. It contains a complete technical summary of the project "Surprend Moi," a WhatsApp marketplace for Burundi. Here's a structured breakdown of its contents:

Project Overview
Surprend Moi — A marketplace that aggregates WhatsApp sellers in Burundi. Buyers browse products, click "Discuter," and are redirected to the seller's wa.me link. All negotiation happens on WhatsApp, never on the site.

Account types:

Vendeur (Seller): Registers, logs in, publishes products (photo + name + price + category + description), deletes sold products.

Client (Buyer): Registers, logs in, browses products.

Visiteur (Visitor): No account, can browse and click to chat.

Admin: Dashboard with all statistics (visits, sellers, products, negotiations, seller attempts).

Technical Stack
Component	Technology
Hosting	GitHub Pages (free, HTTPS)
Database	Google Sheets
Backend/API	Google Apps Script (Web App)
Frontend	HTML, CSS, vanilla JavaScript (2G-compatible, lightweight)
Negotiation	wa.me (WhatsApp link)
Image compression	Canvas API (browser-side)
Authentication	Email + SHA-256 hashed password, stored in localStorage, compared to hash in Google Sheets
File Structure
text
