Deployment config:

Type: Web App

Execute as: Me

Who has access: Everyone

After code changes: Deploy > Manage deployments > pencil > New version > Deploy (URL stays the same)

Authentication
Password hashed with SHA-256 in the browser before sending

Hash stored in Google Sheets (PasswordHash column)

Session saved in localStorage (sm_session)

