Known Current Limitations
Google Apps Script: ~500 requests/day quota on free tier

Google Sheets: slows beyond 500 visits/day or 20 products with base64 photos

No POST response reading due to no-cors: impossible to show real error messages for registrations and product additions

No server session: session is purely client-side (localStorage)

Unstable internet in Burundi: cause of random errors

Planned Next Steps
Fix and validate product addition (photo properly saved in Sheet, appears in seller dashboard)

Add real error messages for POST (requires leaving no-cors, thus changing backend)

Future migration to PHP + MySQL hosting (free InfinityFree, or paid Hostinger) once platform has users

Add online payment (Lumicash, Ecocash, Smart Pesa) later

Monetization: seller subscription (10,000,000 FBu/month once platform is full)

